     LEFT col: eyebrow + H1 + (desktop-only) book-info card.
     RIGHT col: book image + (mobile-only) book-info card + copyright.
     The card content is duplicated in HTML; CSS hides whichever copy
     doesn't fit the current viewport. Mirrors the source's responsive
     content-swap pattern (Bricks @media max-width: 478px overrides). */
  .rt-hero { background: #fff; }
  .rt-hero-container {
    max-width: var(--container-max);
    margin: 0 auto;
